# The opens of a terminal without O_NOCTTY that are meant.  Checked by
# tests/check-tty-open.sh.
#
#   file|call|count|pass|reason
#
# "count" is how many such calls the file has: more or fewer fails, and a line
# that matches nothing is stale.  "keep" is a permanent exception.

we_child.c|open|1|keep|the child's own terminal, opened by the new session leader after the fork
